# Accepted vulnerabilities. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date (exp:); after that date
# Trivy reports it again and CI fails until it is reviewed.
#
# Fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4). Spring Boot 3.5.16 ships the last free 6.2.x.
# Agreed on 2026-11-25: stay on Spring Boot 3.5 for Phase 1, move to Spring Boot 4 in Phase 2.

# spring-webmvc XsltView path issue. The app has no XsltView or XSLT views.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31

# spring-webmvc / spring-webflux. Fix only in Spring Framework 7.0.9.
CVE-2026-47890 exp:2027-01-31

# spring-webflux functional endpoints. The app serves no WebFlux endpoints
# (WebFlux is only the HTTP client used by Spring AI).
CVE-2026-47892 exp:2027-01-31
